        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BLD125HMRSAL, Hammered Boulder Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Boulder Door Pull is a great addition to any modern home. The hammered finish gives it an earthly feel that is very in right now. The Boulder 125 Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from a huge selection of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/offset-square-boulder-door-pull-first-impressions-bld125hmrfal\"><b>Offset Square Boulder Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Boulder 125 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BLD01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262334\"><b>First Impressions BLD125HMRSAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-BLD125018HMRSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-BLD125024HMRSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-BLD125036HMRSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
